        "sections": [
            {
                "tag": "h1",
                "content": "Artificial Intelligence (AI)"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Get comprehensive AI services and state-of-the-art generative AI innovations on our data platform and in our cloud applications\u2014all on a best-in-class AI infrastructure."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Oracle and DeepLearning.AI Launch New Agent Memory Course for AI Developers"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Join us this May to see how we\u2019re partnering with NVIDIA to deliver enterprise-grade AI built for real business outcomes. Learn how to deploy and customize OCI AI Accelerator Packs with NVIDIA GPUs."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Ready to learn how generative AI can help you stay ahead of the competition? Learn about top initiatives you can start today."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore 10 practical, high-impact applications of AI\u2014particularly AI agents\u2014in healthcare, retail, finance, and other industries to inspire fresh ideas for your business."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Oracle offers a Free Tier for most AI services as well as a 30-day free trial account with US$300 in credit to try additional cloud services. Get the details and sign up for your free account."
            },
            {
                "tag": "h2",
                "content": "Explore the AI trends shaping business in 2026"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Discover the latest AI trends and insights through this webinar series and ebook."
            },
            {
                "tag": "h3",
                "content": "Learn about the future of GenAI: Beyond the hype curve"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Join OCI Chief Technical Architect Pradeep Vincent and OCI Chief Data Scientist Dan Roth for a discussion on GenAI trends and OCI innovations tackling emerging business challenges."
            },
            {
                "tag": "h2",
                "content": "Oracle AI in action"
            },
            {
                "tag": "h2",
                "content": "Artificial intelligence partners and customers"
            },
            {
                "tag": "h2",
                "content": "Discover why companies across the world choose OCI to deploy AI"
            },
            {
                "tag": "h2",
                "content": "Discover AI capabilities"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Surface insights directly inside the apps that support your key business functions with embedded, fully functional AI capabilities."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore Oracle Cloud Applications"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Choose from managed open source or proprietary LLMs. Fine-tune prebuilt models and augment them with your own enterprise data. Turn intelligence into action with AI agents."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore generative AI"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Add prebuilt models to your applications to leverage AI that can be customized with your own data for improved model quality."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore AI services"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Collaboratively build, train, deploy, and manage machine learning (ML) models with your favorite open source frameworks, or leverage in-database ML."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore machine learning"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Benefit from the cloud\u2019s elasticity, usage-based costs, and the performance you need, delivered anywhere with OCI\u2019s distributed cloud."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore GPUs for AI"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Accelerate and streamline AI innovation with help from our partners."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore Oracle\u2019s AI ISVs"
            },
            {
                "tag": "h2",
                "content": "Additional Oracle AI resources"
            },
            {
                "tag": "h2",
                "content": "Get started with Oracle AI"
            },
            {
                "tag": "h3",
                "content": "Try Oracle AI and get a 30-day trial"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Oracle offers a free pricing tier for most AI services as well as a free trial account with US$300 in credits to try additional cloud services. Get the details and sign up for your free account."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "You also only have to pay compute and storage charges for OCI Data Science."
            },
            {
                "tag": "h3",
                "content": "Learn with an AI hands-on lab"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "The best way to learn something is to try it yourself. Use our tutorials and hands-on labs with your own Oracle Cloud tenancy, at no charge for many services."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "With the help of generative AI, you'll provide a list of ingredients to a pretrained recipe generator to decide what to make."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore concepts in OCI Data Science to improve workflow efficiency and become more productive."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Explore how to work with multiple chatbots and digital assistants in Oracle Digital Assistant."
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Discover how to automate sophisticated text analysis at scale without machine learning expertise."
            },
            {
                "tag": "h3",
                "content": "See how to apply AI today"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Enter a new era of productivity with generative AI solutions for your business. Learn how Oracle helps customers leverage AI embedded across the full technology stack."
            },
            {
                "tag": "h3",
                "content": "Contact sales"
            },
            {
                "tag": "p",
                "content": "Interested in learning more about Oracle AI? Let one of our experts help."
            }
